@@ -26,6 +26,18 @@ This tool implements an ACP agent by using the official [Claude Agent SDK](https
 
 Learn more about the [Agent Client Protocol](https://agentclientprotocol.com/).
 
+### Proposed subscription route mode
+
+`--require-claude-subscription` is an opt-in adapter admission policy for a
+controlled, dedicated `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` and `HOME`. It is mutually exclusive
+with `--hide-claude-auth`. The mode offers only local `claude-ai-login`, rejects
+API/gateway/provider and client session overrides, and permits fresh sessions
+only. It checks the SDK's first-party subscription account at query creation
+and before each prompt. The SDK account view is cached for the query lifetime;
+this policy cannot attest a fresh credential, a paid plan's billing terms, or
+an immutable route after an out-of-band credential change. Do not treat it as a
+billing receipt.
+
 To try changes that have landed on `main` but are not released yet, install from the
 `preview` channel — every push to `main` publishes one. See
 [`docs/RELEASES.md`](docs/RELEASES.md#preview-releases).
